{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB花旦陳瀅憑亮麗外貌與姣好身材，一直是不少網民心中的女神。近日在台慶劇《璀璨之城》中更有大膽演出，穿上黑色透視內衣色誘張智霖，部分鏡頭更呈現近乎全裸的效果，引起網民熱議。雖然負評甚多，被指尺度過火，但她懶理負評，開心迎接37歲生日。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅一直是不少網民心中的女神。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192293707387375616573146.jpeg/XCtJnq64pxzcFghKywpT8v0JIi4FeuO0wTn5qcE5-ak\"/><figcaption>陳瀅一直是不少網民心中的女神。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅擁有亮麗外貌與姣好身材。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192293704837107712549617.jpeg/N8pYRE21WqUB_xY2zZgobML24IV_7NTS00eRONNHkTg\"/><figcaption>陳瀅擁有亮麗外貌與姣好身材。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure><p>迎37歲大曬巨型玫瑰</p><p>上星期踏入37歲生日的陳瀅，日前在社交平台分享手捧巨型紅玫瑰花束的慶生照，昨日（27日）再分享去旅遊並享受陽光與海灘的照片：「a week of wellness」，與粉絲分享她豐富充實且充滿健康的個人生活。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅手捧巨型紅玫瑰花束。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192293505230311424389167.jpeg/tjxh5GjUYEFJKIlZAD61bqmzXypR4I6QPeDbmD3g25g\"/><figcaption>陳瀅手捧巨型紅玫瑰花束。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅分享去旅遊並享受陽光與海灘的照片。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192293502797484032520976.jpeg/XNr-3GUdMuHrBUKUiCdBNMB95XNY5WT2qNhV_qjYVf4\"/><figcaption>陳瀅分享去旅遊並享受陽光與海灘的照片。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure><p>換黑泳裝歎陽光海灘</p><p>從照片可見，陳瀅狀態輕鬆自在，她穿上綠色運動連身裙打網球，盡顯青春活力。她又以條紋無肩帶上衣配牛仔褲親近大自然，向大象擺出可愛獻吻表情，更舉起香檳留影，笑容燦爛。此外，她亦換上簡約黑色泳裝、戴上草帽，在泳池邊享受陽光，並漫步清澈海水中，造型自然大方，流露優雅迷人的女神氣質。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅換黑泳裝歎陽光海灘。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192294137782079488346075.jpeg/2-9Z999wDJTkw7kUsdmTFElEERNyuGaLs3fIf7N3yH8\"/><figcaption>陳瀅換黑泳裝歎陽光海灘。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅又以條紋無肩帶上衣配牛仔褲親近大自然。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192294135542190080398127.jpeg/vM5A3-Bd22GRjeiVS7zE8E5glKZ9QweID-khAQ_pIQE\"/><figcaption>陳瀅又以條紋無肩帶上衣配牛仔褲親近大自然。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅向大象擺出可愛獻吻表情。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192294133277134848651843.jpeg/G1uQHnrwJ4j2ggnDGti-1Dkc7dywbtxl1ktyA9ZLcgM\"/><figcaption>陳瀅向大象擺出可愛獻吻表情。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅打板球。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192294130802364416849573.jpeg/l0lUJLz9RgaEwVRXwUY618otPAwrI6dJyJmKlMiZipQ\"/><figcaption>陳瀅打板球。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅好sexy。(ig@missjni)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192294128486977536086492.jpeg/Cq-FBAzRvvcptFOgF-DAfZDV-NvXR10YFaumrBWrpqw\"/><figcaption>陳瀅好sexy。(ig@missjni)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:41:28.005173+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":620,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T05:30:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:59:21.453236+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:38:31.387207+00:00","content_hash":"d0b499967ceba7c96704fa0349f7befadaafaf3a060f973b23a64be5615b01b9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}